BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Colossal Vail 50/50
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261205
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261206
DTSTAMP:20261103T183242Z
UID:bf54f747e694eeac359942f6@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:An ultra run on portions of the Arizona Trail near the communi
 ty of Vail (24 miles southeast of Tucson). It is the first leg in the[Sout
 hern Arizona Triple 50](https://runazt.org/southern-arizona-triple-50/). S
 tarting and finishing at Colossal Cave Mountain Park\, the 50-mile\, 55K a
 nd Half-Marathon courses feature some of the greatest high desert trail ru
 nning opportunities in this part of the state. The course is designed as a
  relatively fast trail ultra on rolling terrain with great scenery. The CV
  50/50 uses most of the Arizona Trail Passages 7 & 8\, which link the Sant
 a Rita Mountains south of the Tucson Basin to the Rincon Mountains on the 
 east side of the Basin on the ancestral lands of the Tohono O’odham and 
 Pascua Yaqui. Parts of the trail skirt the east edge of the Sonoran Desert
 \, where the Mexican Highlands borders it\, a transition zone to the Chihu
 ahuan Desert and some of the Sky Islands mountain ranges of southeast Ariz
 ona.[](https://runazt.org/colossal-vail-50-50/)\n\nEvent website: https://
 runazt.org/colossal-vail-50-50/\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visi
 tarizona.com/events/colossal-vail-50-50
LAST-MODIFIED:20261103T183242Z
URL:https://www.visitarizona.com/events/colossal-vail-50-50
END:VEVENT
